      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دخّل</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَدْخِيلٌ</span>, <i>He put</i> dates <i>into a</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَوْخَلَّة</span> [q. v.]. (TA.) [In the present day, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دخّلهُ</span>
is used in the first of the senses assigned below to
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدْخَلَهُ</span>; but for this I have not found any classical
authority.]

